{
  "topic": "Perl",
  "objective": "Provide an expert-level, implementation-oriented outline of Perl covering language fundamentals, dynamic typing, scalars, arrays, hashes, references, subroutines, closures, object systems, packages, modules, regular expressions, text processing, file and process I/O, exceptions, data serialization, concurrency, networking, security, performance, testing, tooling, and production architecture.",
